<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>StudyHubSA | Study Smarter</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f4f7fb;
      color: #172033;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed);
      color: white;
      padding: 25px 8%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 80px 20px;
      background: white;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #4f46e5;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 20px;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: #4f46e5;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 60px 8%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .section h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-7px);
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #4f46e5;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .cta {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed);
      color: white;
      padding: 60px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      font-size: 35px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .cta .btn {
      background: white;
      color: #4f46e5;
    }

    footer {
      background: #111827;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header {
        text-align: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 15px;
      }

      nav a {
        margin: 0 8px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">📚 StudyHubSA</div>

    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#subjects">Subjects</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <h1>Study Smarter. Achieve More.</h1>

    <p>
      Welcome to StudyHubSA — a simple online study platform
      designed to help South African students learn, revise and
      reach their academic goals.
    </p>

    <a href="#subjects" class="btn">Start Studying 🚀</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="subjects">
    <h2>📖 Explore Subjects</h2>

    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card">
        <h3>➗ Mathematics</h3>
        <p>
          Improve your maths skills with revision resources,
          study tips and helpful explanations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🔬 Physical Sciences</h3>
        <p>
          Understand important concepts and prepare better
          for your tests and exams.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🧬 Life Sciences</h3>
        <p>
          Revise biology topics and make studying easier
          with organised learning material.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>📚 English</h3>
        <p>
          Improve your language skills, writing and
          comprehension.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🌍 Geography</h3>
        <p>
          Explore geography topics and prepare for your
          upcoming assessments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>💼 Business Studies</h3>
        <p>
          Learn business concepts and prepare for
          exams with confidence.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="about">
    <h2>🎓 About StudyHubSA</h2>

    <p style="max-width:700px;margin:auto;line-height:1.7;color:#666;">
      StudyHubSA is built to give students easy access to useful
      study resources in one place. Our goal is to make studying
      simpler, smarter and more accessible.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <h2>Ready to improve your marks?</h2>

    <p>
      Start learning today and take the next step towards your goals.
    </p>

    <a href="#subjects" class="btn">Explore StudyHubSA</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 StudyHubSA. All rights reserved.</p>
    <p>Study Smarter. Achieve More. 🇿🇦</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
